  "label": "The window cleaner is mapped as the person experiencing the futility of effort.",
  "description": "The text 'when you wipe 700 times and there is still shit' is mapped onto the visual entity 'window_cleaner'. The cleaner's persistent action of wiping the window, despite the visible dirt, visually represents the textual description of futile effort. The cleaner is the subject of the text, embodying the experience of doing something repeatedly without achieving the desired outcome.",
